    "description": {
      "value": "<p><em>(3rd Level)</em></p><p><em>“If it shouldn’t be there, I remove the sentence.”</em></p><p>Your Subtractive Editing Mode becomes enhanced.</p><p>When you cast a manifestation that:</p><ul><li><p>Banishes</p></li><li><p>Dispels</p></li><li><p>Restrains</p></li><li><p>Silences</p></li><li><p>Negates</p></li><li><p>Suppresses</p></li></ul><p>You may apply <strong>one Redaction Effect</strong>:</p><ol><li><p><strong>Erase Presence</strong> — Target becomes partially removed (treat as invisible or untargetable) until your next turn.</p></li><li><p><strong>Revoke Permission</strong> — Target loses access to one ability/manifestation/feature until your next turn.</p></li><li><p><strong>Cut Continuity</strong> — One ongoing effect ends immediately (Clarity hold snaps; summons destabilize).</p></li></ol><p><strong>Cost:</strong><br />Spend 1 Surge and gain +1 misfire risk.</p><p>This is not damage.<br />It is absence.</p><p></p>",
      "chat": ""
    },
